6:["$","$Lc",null,{"heading":"Our _team_","members":[{"id":"683","name":"Roos WÃ¼stefeld","position":"Co-owner","tel":"31 (0)6 53 536 085","mail":"info@aerodynamics.nl","content":"Roos has been part of the Aerodynamics Private Jets team since 2017. Her father Ronald is a shareholder, alongside Huyb and Jan. Before joining, she worked at Schiphol Travel International, where she gained extensive experience in client relations and commercial processes. Since 2022, she is co-owner and feels completely at home in the family business.","linkedIn":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/rooswustefeld/","imageSrc":"https://aerodynamics-bucket.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com/d962e6571647a56edd55fc609d6a2a12.jpg","imageSrcMobile":"https://aerodynamics-bucket.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com/0ab1d8ee9970f2013d8a8f52a0473011.jpg","imageAlt":"Roos WÃ¼stefeld"},{"id":"684","name":"David Roosjen-Billet","position":"Co-owner","tel":"+31 (0)6 25 339 876","mail":"info@aerodynamics.nl","content":"David has been part of the Aerodynamics Private Jets team since 2016. As a young boy, he was already wandering around the Aerodynamics office, fascinated by everything that flies. His father is one of the original shareholders. With his experience in aviation, including at Transavia Ad-Hoc Charter Sales, he feels completely at home with us. Since 2022, he is co-owner and a valued constant in the team.","linkedIn":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/david-roosjen-8b879389/","imageSrc":"https://aerodynamics-bucket.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com/f47b88208ea949f45a7fe3ede85a2850.jpg","imageSrcMobile":"https://aerodynamics-bucket.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com/439fdef2945def6122a406d9962c0f02.jpg","imageAlt":"David Roosjen-Billet"},{"id":"685","name":"Sophie van Monsjou","position":"Co-owner","tel":"+31 (0)6 31 339 571","mail":"info@aerodynamics.nl","content":"Sophie has been part of the Aerodynamics Private Jets team since 2019 and is the daughter of founder Huyb. With a background in sales and hospitality, she draws great energy from arranging every flight down to the finest detail. She will never admit it herself, but over the years aircraft have quietly become her guilty pleasure.","linkedIn":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/aerodynamics-b.v./","imageSrc":"https://aerodynamics-bucket.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com/b22014b1f032435867022824061a5189.jpg","imageSrcMobile":"https://aerodynamics-bucket.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com/fa85100772db4778c5e27fbec54d79aa.jpg","imageAlt":"Sophie van Monsjou"},{"id":"686","name":"Merijn Mensink","position":"Sales Executive","tel":"+31 (0) 6 13 207 167","mail":"info@aerodynamics.nl","content":"As David's closest friend, Merijn has remained within the inner circle, making him the first non-family member of the team, but valued no less for it. With experience in the industry and his meticulous way of working, he is the driving force behind this company.","linkedIn":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/merijnmensink/","imageSrc":"https://aerodynamics-bucket.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com/f8585c3432614380010fcd1df82d4bb5.jpg","imageSrcMobile":"https://aerodynamics-bucket.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com/913d58483c0905be8350a270d8977169.jpg","imageAlt":"Merijn Mensink"},{"id":"687","name":"Huyb van Monsjou","position":"Founder and co-owner","tel":"+31 (0)6 53 164 688","mail":"info@aerodynamics.nl","content":"After successfully founding an airline, Huyb chose a new direction. In 1986, he established Aerodynamics as the first broker in the Netherlands and over the past 40 years has built it into what it is today. Still closely involved with the company, with a little more time to himself after 40 years of hard work.","linkedIn":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/aerodynamics-b.v./","imageSrc":"https://aerodynamics-bucket.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com/1f1ce9a74edf5d52295982373867b1a3.webp","imageSrcMobile":"https://aerodynamics-bucket.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com/28b70a6d2c39aa7d7c3b75db99d48ec5.webp","imageAlt":"Huyb van Monsjou"},{"id":"688","name":"Chantal de Jong","position":"Sales Executive","tel":"+31 (0)6 16 011 558","mail":"info@aerodynamics.nl","content":"Chantal is the newest addition to our team (2025). She brings extensive experience in the travel industry, both with tour operators and in the private jet world. She knows the ropes inside out. Exactly the kind of added value we were looking for.","linkedIn":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/chantal-de-jong-875b461a/","imageSrc":"https://aerodynamics-bucket.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com/ff1bea6a181e7cb75a515c860740c231.jpg","imageSrcMobile":"https://aerodynamics-bucket.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com/a7acfd00d24360490e2830417ab5451a.jpg","imageAlt":"Chantal de Jong"},{"id":"689","name":"Jan Roosjen","position":"Co-owner / Retired","tel":"+31 (0) 20 604 1667","mail":"info@aerodynamics.nl","content":"After years of working in the travel industry, Jan joined Aerodynamics in 1991 as co-owner. Together with Huyb, he helped place the company on an even stronger footing, a dedication he carried through until his retirement in 2024.","linkedIn":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/aerodynamics-b.v./","imageSrc":"https://aerodynamics-bucket.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com/61a6574c65cee2a3740c7e38bbd48ccd.webp","imageSrcMobile":"https://aerodynamics-bucket.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com/a26661521e07adb17571d15255311ea2.webp","imageAlt":"Jan Roosjen"},{"id":"690","name":"Ronald WÃ¼stefeld","position":"Co-owner / Retired","tel":"+31 (0) 20 604 1667","mail":"info@aerodynamics.nl","content":"Here too, the apple did not fall far from the tree. As a close friend of Jan, the decision was quickly made. Since joining in 2001, Ronald has consistently brought modernisation to the company and made an equal contribution to the success and continuity of Aerodynamics. He now keeps a watchful eye on how the younger generation is getting on, since retiring in 2025.","linkedIn":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/aerodynamics-b.v./","imageSrc":"https://aerodynamics-bucket.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com/ebe6dc69aa358070a7ea4e4aa66f32f0.webp","imageSrcMobile":"https://aerodynamics-bucket.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com/03507660c0aaef5081ffec224591b292.webp","imageAlt":"Ronald WÃ¼stefeld"}]}]
